{"id":"7c8c1b19ad8b296f","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-hierarchy-interface.md","title":"Effective Hierarchy Recognition and Normalization","display":"df-hierarchy-interface — Effective Hierarchy Recognition and Normalization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-hierarchy-interface","aliases":["67-df-hierarchy-interface"],"display":"df-hierarchy-interface — Effective Hierarchy Recognition and Normalization","depends_on":["[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-hierarchy-interface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-hierarchy-interface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hierarchy-interface — Effective Hierarchy Recognition and Normalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的程序图公式族、层级及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{0,n}=\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Gamma_{0,n}=\\Sigma_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{1,n}=\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Gamma_{1,n}=\\Pi_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(c:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(r:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是候选算法参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 识别公式类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 输出 PA 等价的同层量词正规式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 给出每个公式的一个层级界。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PNF}_{\\varepsilon,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{PNF}_{\\varepsilon,n}\\)</span> 是下式递归给出的至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个交替量词块的公式集合；允许空量词块。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 是有限各异变量列。使用本接口的条目额外固定满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\\)</span> 的同一三元组。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PNF}\\)</span> 的递归指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 遍历全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hierarchy}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hierarchy}\\)</span> 中的层级指标仍限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{0,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n,&amp;\\Gamma_{1,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Pi_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}_{0,0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PRFml}_A,&amp;\\mathrm{PNF}_{1,0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PRFml}_A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}_{0,k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\exists\\vec x\\,\\theta:\\mathrm{Distinct}_{L_A}(\\vec x)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PNF}_{1,k}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}_{1,k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,\\theta:\\mathrm{Distinct}_{L_A}(\\vec x)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PNF}_{0,k}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow c\\in\\mathrm{PR}_3\\land r\\in\\mathrm{PR}_3\\land b\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon&lt;2\\forall n\\ge1\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\bigl(c(\\varepsilon,n,z)=1\\leftrightarrow z\\in g[\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}]\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon&lt;2\\forall n\\ge1\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PNF}_{\\varepsilon,n}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad r(\\varepsilon,n,g(\\varphi))=g(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\theta)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\ \\bigl[b(g(\\varphi))\\ge1\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_{b(g(\\varphi))}\\cap\\Pi_{b(g(\\varphi))}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{0,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n,&amp;\\Gamma_{1,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\Pi_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}_{0,0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PRFml}_A,&amp;\\mathrm{PNF}_{1,0}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PRFml}_A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}_{0,k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\exists\\vec x\\,\\theta:\\mathrm{Distinct}_{L_A}(\\vec x)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PNF}_{1,k}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}_{1,k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,\\theta:\\mathrm{Distinct}_{L_A}(\\vec x)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PNF}_{0,k}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow c\\in\\mathrm{PR}_3\\land r\\in\\mathrm{PR}_3\\land b\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon&lt;2\\forall n\\ge1\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\bigl(c(\\varepsilon,n,z)=1\\leftrightarrow z\\in g[\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}]\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon&lt;2\\forall n\\ge1\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PNF}_{\\varepsilon,n}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad r(\\varepsilon,n,g(\\varphi))=g(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\theta)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\ \\bigl[b(g(\\varphi))\\ge1\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_{b(g(\\varphi))}\\cap\\Pi_{b(g(\\varphi))}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该附加接口将原文件的“Fact 5 正规化”“PR 识别”及层级覆盖约定明写为算法参数的条件。它不声称任意满足逐数表示的图公式族都自动满足这些条件；精确对象仍对 Hypothesis 中固定的参数相对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]] 的程序图公式族、层级及 $g$。$\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}$，$\\Gamma_{0,n}=\\Sigma_n$，$\\Gamma_{1,n}=\\Pi_n$；$n\\ge1$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{0,n}=\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{1,n}=\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"c:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PNF}_{\\varepsilon,n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PNF}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hierarchy}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{0,n}&\\coloneqq\\Sigma_n,&\\Gamma_{1,n}&\\coloneqq\\Pi_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}_{0,0}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PRFml}_A,&\\mathrm{PNF}_{1,0}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PRFml}_A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}_{0,k+1}&\\coloneqq\\{\\exists\\vec x\\,\\theta:\\mathrm{Distinct}_{L_A}(\\vec x)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PNF}_{1,k}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}_{1,k+1}&\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec x\\,\\theta:\\mathrm{Distinct}_{L_A}(\\vec x)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PNF}_{0,k}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)&\\Longleftrightarrow c\\in\\mathrm{PR}_3\\land r\\in\\mathrm{PR}_3\\land b\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon<2\\forall n\\ge1\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\bigl(c(\\varepsilon,n,z)=1\\leftrightarrow z\\in g[\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}]\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon<2\\forall n\\ge1\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_{\\varepsilon,n}\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PNF}_{\\varepsilon,n}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&\\qquad r(\\varepsilon,n,g(\\varphi))=g(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\theta)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\ \\bigl[b(g(\\varphi))\\ge1\\land\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_{b(g(\\varphi))}\\cap\\Pi_{b(g(\\varphi))}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3113,"backlinks":[{"id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"精确字面公式类随已声明的图公式参数变化；关于统一正规化、公式类识别或部分真公式的算法条件，必须使用 [[67-df-hierarchy-interface]] 的显式附加接口，不能由逐数表示性质单独推出。原文件的来源页码仅作继承的来源线索，本次没有用户书籍 PDF 可供复核。"},{"id":"0e6c8c75d056b765","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0507b673d2cc3959","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-hierarchy-interface]] — Effective Hierarchy Recognition and Normalization。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[..